<body>
    <h1>Commands Session in IGEL OS 12</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"2dc92b61-ced7-403c-9cf2-dff0896720e5">This article s=
hows how to set up system command sessions in IGEL OS.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"7e1fe640-7af1-435d-a61f-ffa21b3b2184">
<p local-id=3D"d2afecb4-c818-4612-86cc-4821d05f0869">Menu path: <strong>Use=
r Interface &gt; Commands &gt; Shutdown menu / Sort icons / Restart windowm=
anager</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"880c534c-05a9-43f3-8b97-66cf724213b1"></p><span class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual=
-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-bor=
der image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"81a29a22db257137245a9=
9b2657086e7bd18f5d33a64f323653dc4a6e6d0b443" data-image-src=3D"https://igel=
-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302824/OS12.2_Command%20Ses=
sions.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1716364675154&amp;cacheVersion=
=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"841" data-width=3D"1091" data-unresolved-=
comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73309068" data-linked-resour=
ce-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resou=
rce-default-alias=3D"OS12.2_Command Sessions.png" data-base-url=3D"https://=
igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/pn=
g" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302824" data-linked-resource-cont=
ainer-version=3D"8" data-media-id=3D"0e93871f-e033-4c37-b8c7-2a321ad4ad81" =
data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"361"></span>
<p local-id=3D"a896cc36-92fc-4969-b974-bd7526ee8462"><span class=3D"legacy-=
color-text-blue3">System commands can be made accessible to the user throug=
h configuring them as sessions:</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"bf6eb16c-5f5e-4e53-a2f2-fb6d5a125887">
<li local-id=3D"7ee21325-5471-4f03-aaef-cace4f906e6b">
<p local-id=3D"4649f92f-a830-4445-8a1b-b1eb556d5031"><strong>Shutdown menu<=
/strong>: Opens the shutdown menu. You can configure the shutdown menu unde=
r <strong>System &gt; Power Options &gt; Shutdown</strong>. For more inform=
ation, see <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://kb.igel.com/en/igel-o=
s-base-system/current/shutdown-settings-in-igel-os-12" rel=3D"nofollow">Shu=
tdown Settings in IGEL OS 12</a>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0f4760e4-ab7d-4e02-b312-0183007a14ff">
<p local-id=3D"03449184-0894-4004-befc-dc677cfffda1"><strong>Sort icons</st=
rong>: Arranges the icons into a structured grid layout. Icons are automati=
cally aligned in vertical columns and grouped together to form a clean, com=
pact block instead of being freely positioned on the screen.</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"1697af37d852">The sorting behavior of desktop icons can also=
 be configured in IGEL Setup under <strong>System &gt; Registry &gt; window=
smanager &gt; defaulttheme &gt; icon_sort</strong>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"89be5115fd99">Two sorting options are available:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"709fa3cb723f">
<li local-id=3D"06a2577d-52fa-4638-bdd3-ada5ac19b9cc">
<p local-id=3D"dca0dbd7d2f0"><strong>Default</strong>: Uses the original so=
rting behavior. Icons are arranged according to the internal filename and f=
ollow the standard system sorting logic. This preserves the existing behavi=
or and layout.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"94ec4fe2-8dac-4781-bf7c-e40a3ccaccc2">
<p local-id=3D"1479e744ee2b"><strong>Alphanumeric</strong>: Automatically s=
orts icons in order from 0=E2=80=939 and A=E2=80=93Z. Numbers are sorted nu=
merically, followed by letters in alphabetical order.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<ul local-id=3D"b7c4d659888b">
<li local-id=3D"a389beb2-d1ff-41ef-a1a0-7002bcca5b38">
<p local-id=3D"3619620c-1348-4562-9bd4-ff60088ad9c2"><strong>Restart window=
manager</strong>: Restarts the device's user interface.</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"error">
<span class=3D"error">Unable to render {include}</span> The included page c=
ould not be found.
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"9b0427c6-883f-452d-92d1-5f0e6afe2ed0" id=3D"CommandsSession=
inIGELOS12-QuickAccess">Quick Access</h2>
<p local-id=3D"6a72c827-251c-4baf-9e85-f27a3b43b7e3">Menu path: <strong>Use=
r Interface &gt; Commands &gt; Shutdown Menu &gt; Quick Access</strong></p>=
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluen=
ce-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence=
-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"4e5=
e492913ed935e8607042c401be5e4f8ab2f01f0c61a1c2791230f67049094" data-image-s=
rc=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302824/OS=
12.2_Commands.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1716364675162&amp;cach=
eVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"816" data-width=3D"974" data-unre=
solved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73308951" data-linked=
-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linke=
d-resource-default-alias=3D"OS12.2_Commands.png" data-base-url=3D"https://i=
gel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png=
" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302824" data-linked-resource-conta=
iner-version=3D"8" data-media-id=3D"ffa32192-31ef-455a-be3a-68c7515912d4" d=
ata-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"392"></span>
<p local-id=3D"eed6a948-3d9d-4f5d-afc3-dfc9a0dbf56b">Here, you can configur=
e the quick access to the shutdown menu from the start menu and the Applica=
tion Launcher.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b20eab38-b36d-47eb-8c37-4a26eeeb02c3"></p>
<p local-id=3D"613a9763-c62b-4cf8-a863-01ae4ba68a00"><strong>Show Shutdown =
menu button</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"299f93a1-a76a-46e2-aa7c-8d4d70c160fc">=E2=98=91 The <span cl=
ass=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-=
image confluence-content-image-inline" alt=3D"image-20240613-080759.png" lo=
